WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,840 --> 00:00:07,440
Get up, it’s dawn, Brother Mouchuan

2
00:00:07,760 --> 00:00:08,920
The wind was really scary last night

3
00:00:09,240 --> 00:00:10,280
I woke up once in the middle of the night

4
00:00:10,560 --> 00:00:12,240
I feel like our house is going to be blown away.

5
00:00:12,680 --> 00:00:13,800
Go out and have a look

6
00:00:14,400 --> 00:00:15,800
It snowed so heavily last night

7
00:00:16,040 --> 00:00:19,220
I don’t know what’s going on at the door, right? Brother Mou Chuan

8
00:00:19,380 --> 00:00:21,340
We are also on the cover. It snowed so much last night.

9
00:00:21,580 --> 00:00:31,950
Isn't this door also poisoned to death? That's all.

10
00:00:35,220 --> 00:00:36,220
how is this possible

11
00:00:37,040 --> 00:00:38,120
That wind and snow last night

12
00:00:38,560 --> 00:00:40,160
It sounds scary to me through the wall

13
00:00:40,600 --> 00:00:42,440
Why is there so little snow in front of our door?

14
00:00:45,680 --> 00:00:46,960
Brother Mouchuan, I understand.

15
00:00:46,960 --> 00:00:48,960
No wonder you had to force this door to open in the first place.

16
00:00:48,960 --> 00:00:50,480
Ordinary people's doors are pushed outwards
